# Copy to .env and adjust. Only needed to override the per-platform defaults in src/config.ts
# (http://localhost:8080 on web/iOS, http://10.0.2.2:8080 on the Android emulator).
#
# Required for a PHYSICAL Android device: use your machine's LAN address, since `localhost`
# on the phone means the phone itself. Find it with `ipconfig getifaddr en0`.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.24:8080
#
# Also REQUIRED for the deployed web build: EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined at build time,
# so set this in the Vercel project's environment variables (not at runtime) and it must be
# https -- an https:// page cannot call an http:// API.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com
